msgstr ""

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Charge your customer for the resulting amount and you're all set!"
msgstr "Laat je klant het resterende bedrag betalen, en voilà!"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Charge your guests"
msgstr "Gasten laten betalen"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Check and adjust if needed the number of guest who stayed in each room. Then "
"confirm the number of city tax to be charged, which updated the delivered "
"city tax count."
msgstr ""
"Controleer en pas indien nodig het aantal gasten dat in elke kamer heeft "
"verbleven aan. Bevestig vervolgens het aantal keer dat de toeristenbelasting "
"gerekend moet worden."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Check guests in"
msgstr "Gasten inchecken"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Check guests out"
msgstr "Gasten uitchecken"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Check the invoice data and confirm it."
msgstr "Controleer de factuurgegevens en bevestig."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"City Taxes are to be billed to spent nights in practice and not in theory "
"and are counted as the sum of nights each guest stayed."
msgstr ""
"Toeristenbelasting wordt in rekening gebracht voor het aantal daadwerkelijk "
"doorgebrachte nachten per gast, en niet op basis van het aantal geboekte "
"nachten."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Click one of the house to book."
msgstr "Klik op een van de huizen om te reserveren."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Click the Check in button to confirm they are now staying at your place!"
msgstr ""
"Klik op de knop Inchecken om te bevestigen dat ze nu bij jou verblijven!"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Click the Check out button to capture they return you the keys."
msgstr ""
"Klik op de knop 'Uitchecken' om te registreren dat ze de sleutels hebben "
"ingeleverd."

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Click the Create Order to open the order form."
msgstr "Klik op 'Bestelling aanmaken' om het bestelformulier te openen."

#. module: holiday_house
